# UI Shop (Sanitized)

This edition summarizes the shop interface while omitting sensitive economic and routing data.

## Overview
- Presents the modular layout used for in-run and hub-based purchasing screens.
- Supports configurable offer cards, currency displays, and confirmation prompts.
- Aligns with vendor inventory services through abstracted interfaces.

## Sanitized Notes
- Pricing algorithms, offer weighting rules, and live telemetry callbacks have been removed.
- Transaction auditing steps and entitlement validation are maintained privately.
- Internal commerce guidelines describe the secure checkout and refund flows.
